<title>USA: Brazil coffee areas seen free of damaging frosts.</title>
<headline>Brazil coffee areas seen free of damaging frosts.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is in sight for the next five days in Brazil's coffee regions, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation said.</p>
<p>Low temperatures of 48-62 degrees are expected on Wednesday, followed by 50-64 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Conditions will be mild from Friday to Sunday.</p>
